===
# Code Blocks in SlideDeckML

Syntax highlighting powered by Reveal.js and highlight.js

===
## Simple JavaScript

```javascript
function greet(name) {
    return `Hello, ${name}!`;
}
```

===
## Python with Line Numbers

```python ['lines:1,2-3']
def factorial(n):
    if n <= 1:
        return 1
    return n * factorial(n-1)
```

===
## TypeScript with Custom Start

```typescript ['start:10']
interface User {
    id: number;
    name: string;
    email: string;
}
```

===
## Java with Step Highlighting

```java ['lines:1-2|3-4']
public class HelloWorld {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println("Hello, World!");
    }
}
```

